  "$comment": "Main-menu bindings (v2, M4 C4.1). Single source for the native menu (built by the Tauri host from this file) and for the parity test (11 §14.1). Every command item is a command reference (command id plus optional fixed params); a click is forwarded to the front end, which runs it through the one command entry point, opening a dialog first when the user must give parameters (01 §0). Enablement, check marks and undo labels are live state from the executor; accelerators come from the keymap. enabledWithoutProject follows 01 §1.3. `check` names the state shown as a check mark. Kinds `recent` and `workspaces` are filled at run time from project.recent.list and workspace.list.",
